            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">From a task straight to the moment in the meeting.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.30</h2>
<ul>
  <li>In a task's "Where this came from", clicking the meeting's name or the quoted line now opens that meeting. Before, only the small arrow did, so the meeting looked missing.</li>
  <li>The meeting opens on its transcript, scrolled to the quoted line and highlighted.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
